            "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 5 bx; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.2 lb.;</p><p>Scadrian doctors treat ailments with a variety of remedies, generally made from botanicals such as garlic, parsley, willow, and cypress. During a short rest, you can use a dose of such a treatment to cure a character of one of the following conditions, given that its source isn’t a permanent injury: @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-handbook.handbook.JournalEntry.b684FTgeTTE90HLs.JournalEntryPage.vyYzxzfhwORSeTLw#disoriented]{Disoriented}, @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-handbook.handbook.JournalEntry.b684FTgeTTE90HLs.JournalEntryPage.vyYzxzfhwORSeTLw#exhausted]{Exhausted} (reduces the penalty by 1), or @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-handbook.handbook.JournalEntry.b684FTgeTTE90HLs.JournalEntryPage.vyYzxzfhwORSeTLw#stunned]{Stunned}.</p>",
